        <summary>
          <para>Timestamp base of CameraCharacteristics.SENSOR_INFO_TIMESTAMP_SOURCE.</para>
          <para>The timestamps of the output images are in the time base as specified by CameraCharacteristics.SENSOR_INFO_TIMESTAMP_SOURCE. The application can look up the corresponding result metadata by matching the timestamp with a CameraCaptureSession.CaptureCallback.onCaptureStarted, or with a CameraCaptureSession.CaptureCallback.onReadoutStarted if readout timestamp is used.</para>
